flowchart TD
  D[Recent diff] --> G[Baseline gates]
  G --> R1[Reuse reviewer]
  G --> R2[Quality reviewer]
  G --> R3[Efficiency reviewer]
  R1 --> A[Aggregate findings]
  R2 --> A
  R3 --> A
  A --> F{High-signal fixes?}
  F -- yes --> P[Apply small patch]
  P --> G2[Rerun gates]
  G2 -- fail --> P
  G2 -- pass --> C[Continue to code review or commit]
  F -- no --> C
